  "description": "Bowire Interceptor — unified Traffic rail (replaces the deprecated Proxy + Intercepted rails) + the in-process UseBowireInterceptor() middleware that captures HTTP flows into a singleton InterceptedFlowStore + the InterceptorMockStore that lets workbench-defined rules short-circuit the pipeline + the BowireReverseProxyHost / ReverseProxyRegistry the Tools surface uses to drive standalone reverse-proxy hosts. Adds the three rail descriptors (Proxy / Intercepted / Traffic) AND mounts /api/intercepted/* (+ /api/traffic/* alias) endpoints.",
